## ✿ meet nova ✿

> *"hi hi! i'm Nova (｡•̀ᴗ-)✧ tell me about your day, show me your lunch, or ask me to help with your code. i'll remember you next time!"*

Nova is a chat companion that lives on your own computer. She saves what she learns about you in small local files, so there's no database or cloud storage to set up. ♡

<br>

<div align="center">

･ﾟ✧*:･ﾟ✧　　✧･ﾟ: *✧･ﾟ

</div>

## ♡ what nova can do

<div align="center">

| | feature | what it does |
|:---:|:---|:---|
| 🌸 | **kawaii ui** | soft pastel look with kaomojis in the headers and chat (ﾉ◕ヮ◕)ﾉ*:･ﾟ✧ |
| 🧠 | **long-term memory** | save facts about you to a local JSON file so Nova remembers you between sessions |
| 📝 | **quick notes** | keep snippets, ideas and to-do lists in the sidebar |
| 👀 | **vision** | upload outfits, food, plants or code screenshots and she'll look at them |
| 🎙️ | **voice loop** | talk with your mic and hear her reply out loud |
| 🌍 | **6 languages** | English, Spanish, French, Japanese, Hindi, German |
| 🎭 | **personalities** | pick the vibe you need today (see below) |

</div>

<br>

## ✧ choose her vibe

<div align="center">

| vibe | she is... |
|:---:|:---|
| 🍓 **Friendly & Casual** | your easygoing bestie |
| 😏 **Witty & Sarcastic Friend** | funny, a little spicy |
| 🍵 **Wise Zen Mentor** | calm and thoughtful |
| 📣 **Hyper-Supportive Cheerleader** | "you can do it!!" energy |
| 💻 **Strict Coding Coach** | no excuses, clean code |

</div>

