## ☁ made with

<div align="center">

| | |
|:---:|:---|
| 🎀 **Frontend** | [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io/) |
| 🤖 **AI engine** | Google GenAI SDK (`google-genai`) |
| 🔊 **Voice** | `gTTS` for speech out, `streamlit-mic-recorder` for speech in |
| 🗂️ **Storage** | tiny local JSON files: `memory.json`, `notes.json` |

</div>

<br>

## ⋆｡°✩ getting started

**1 · clone nova**
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Meo-ow0/Nova-your-personal-AI-companion-.git
cd Nova-your-personal-AI-companion-
```

**2 · install the packages**
```bash
pip install streamlit google-genai gtts pillow streamlit-mic-recorder
```

**3 · add your API key** 🔑
Get a free Gemini key from [Google AI Studio](https://aistudio.google.com/) and set it the way `app.py` expects (environment variable or secrets file). Keep it secret and never upload it to GitHub!

**4 · wake her up**
```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

Open the link that appears in your terminal and say hi! (๑˃ᴗ˂)ﻭ

<br>

<div align="center">

･ﾟ✧*:･ﾟ✧　　✧･ﾟ: *✧･ﾟ

</div>

## ☾ privacy notes

- 🌙 Memory and notes stay on **your** computer, in `memory.json` and `notes.json`.
- 🌙 Put `memory.json`, `notes.json` and your key file in `.gitignore` so they never get uploaded.
- 🌙 Chat text, photos and voice are sent to Google's API to get a reply, so don't share anything you want to keep private.

